  "metaTitle": "No-Minimum Custom Rulers | Perfect Imprints",
  "metaDescription": "Order no-minimum custom rulers for small teams or events. No bulk requirements. Get branded rulers in low quantities at Perfect Imprints.",
  "introHtml": "<p>No-minimum custom rulers are designed for buyers who need small quantities without the burden of bulk minimums. Whether you’re a small business ordering for a team of ten, a startup preparing welcome kits, or a manager needing a few samples before committing, this page gives you the flexibility to order as few as one custom ruler. You get the same quality imprint options and fast turnaround, but with the freedom to buy exactly what you need. No wasted inventory, no oversized orders—just the right amount of branded rulers for your specific use case.</p>",
